em to the counter.", "term": "term:renewal"}], "unattached": [{"block": "B-000001", "file": "sdd/specs/CHANGELOG.md", "lines": [3, 3], "text": "Each entry is the board's decision on that date.", "reason": "no_term"}, {"block": "B-000008", "file": "sdd/specs/glossary.md", "lines": [5, 6], "text": "Some older pages say *patron*; a patron is a member.", "reason": "no_term"}, {"block": "B-000012", "file": "sdd/specs/glossary.md", "lines": [16, 16], "text": "It is a date, not a time.", "reason": "no_term"}, {"block": "B-000013", "file": "sdd/specs/glossary.md", "lines": [18, 19], "text": "**Overdue** — a loan whose due date has passed and which has not been returned.", "reason": "no_term"}, {"block": "B-000015", "file": "sdd/specs/glossary.md", "lines": [23, 24], "text": "**Late fee** — the amount a member owes for returning an item after its due date.", "reason": "no_term"}, {"block": "B-000016", "file": "sdd/specs/glossary.md", "lines": [26, 26], "text": "**Available** — an item that exists and is not on loan.", "reason": "no_term"}, {"block": "B-000017", "file": "sdd/specs/glossary.md", "lines": [28, 28], "text": "**Report** — the overdue list for the board (see `reports/spec.md`).", "reason": "no_term"}, {"block": "B-000055", "file": "sdd/specs/loans/spec.md", "lines": [90, 93], "text": "`days_overdue` is the number of days between the due", "reason": "no_term"}, {"block": "B-000055", "file": "sdd/specs/loans/spec.md", "lines": [90, 93], "text": "date and today when the loan is overdue, and 0 otherwise.", "reason": "no_term"}]}, "attention_items": 2, "stopped": null, "model_calls": 98, "cost_usd": 0.5031, "replayed": 4, "alignments": [], "stop_reason": null, "conflicts": {"candidates": 477, "pairs_judged": 477, "pairs_replayed": 0, "by_relation": {"none": 429, "refines": 12, "depends_on": 19, "duplicates": 7, "subsumes": 6, "contradicts": 4}, "opened": 12, "closed": {"rejudged": 0, "member_deleted": 0}, "calls": 65, "provisional": 124, "unjudged_failed": 0, "failed":